Keybindings Reference
=====================

WINDOW MANAGER
Super+Return       Open terminal
Super+Space        Application launcher
Super+q            Close window
Super+s            Toggle floating
Super+f            Toggle fullscreen
Super+Shift+f      Toggle fake fullscreen
Super+a            Toggle maximize screen
Super+g            Toggle gaps
Super+i            Minimize
Super+o            Toggle overlay
Super+Shift+I      Restore minimized
Super+z            Toggle scratchpad
Super+r            Reload config
Super+m            Quit

LAUNCH
Super+w            Firefox browser
Super+h            User guide (l3afpad)
Super+p            Screenshot
Super+Shift+s      Region screenshot
Super+Shift+e      Power menu
Super+Shift+p      Pacman menu
Super+Shift+a      AUR menu
Super+l            Lock screen

FOCUS & SWAP
Super+Tab          Cycle focus
Super+Ctrl+Left    Focus left
Super+Ctrl+Right   Focus right
Super+Ctrl+Up      Focus up
Super+Ctrl+Down    Focus down
Super+Shift+Up     Swap up
Super+Shift+Down   Swap down
Super+Shift+Left   Swap left
Super+Shift+Right  Swap right

TAGS (WORKSPACES)
Super+1-9          Switch to tag
Super+Shift+1-9    Move window to tag
Super+Left         View previous tag
Super+Right        View next tag
Ctrl+Left          View previous tag (skip empty)
Ctrl+Right         View next tag (skip empty)

FLOATING & RESIZE
Ctrl+Shift+Up      Move window up
Ctrl+Shift+Down    Move window down
Ctrl+Shift+Left    Move window left
Ctrl+Shift+Right   Move window right
Ctrl+Super+Up      Resize window up
Ctrl+Super+Down    Resize window down
Ctrl+Super+Left    Resize window left
Ctrl+Super+Right   Resize window right

MONITORS
Super+Alt+Left     Focus left monitor
Super+Alt+Right    Focus right monitor
Super+Ctrl+Alt+Left  Send tag to left monitor
Super+Ctrl+Alt+Right Send tag to right monitor

AUDIO
XF86AudioRaiseVolume   Volume up
XF86AudioLowerVolume   Volume down
XF86AudioMute          Toggle mute

LAYOUT
Super+n            Switch layout
Super+e            Set proportion
Super+x            Switch proportion preset
Super+Shift+X      Increase gaps
Super+Shift+Z      Decrease gaps
